<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich Oct consumer prices up 0.2 pct vs Sept.</title>
<headline>Zurich Oct consumer prices up 0.2 pct vs Sept.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss consumer prices rose 0.2 percent in October in the Swiss canton of Zurich versus the previous month, for a year-on-year rate of increase of 0.9 percent, the Zurich statistics office said.</p>
<p>The yearly rate of increase was higher than the 0.6 percent rise reported in September 1996.</p>
<p>The largest increase was in the energy sector, caused by a rise of 22.6 percent in heating oil prices.</p>
<p>				   Oct 1996   Sept 1996  Oct 1995</p>
<p>Monthly CPI index change   +0.2 pct   +0.1 pct   -0.1  pct</p>
<p>Yr/yr inflation		+0.9 pct   +0.6 pct   +1.8 pct</p>
<p>Index (May 1993 = 100)     103.0	102.9	102.1</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
